# ------------------------------------------------------------------ data
# Market data, model artifacts and backups are large, regenerable, and in some
# cases licence-restricted. They live outside version control by policy.
#
# These are anchored to the repository root on purpose. An unanchored `models/`
# matches at ANY depth, and it silently swallowed `backend/app/models/` — the
# entire SQLAlchemy layer — through the whole of Phase 1. A clean clone would
# not have imported. Keep the leading slash.
/data/
/raw/
/models/
/artifacts/
/backups/
# ML artefacts written next to the code they belong to:
backend/models/
backend/app/ml/models/
*.dump
*.parquet
*.duckdb

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- misc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.log
